# Pairs with FailClosed. The authorizer AddLatticeMcp registers by default
# admits every tool, so a host that opted nothing in is fully open.
MODULE: DefaultAuthorizerAdmits
TARGET: FailClosed
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the default registered authorizer allows instead of denying

--- FIND
      [] authz = "denyAll" -> FALSE
--- REPLACE
      [] authz = "denyAll" -> TRUE
--- END
